INSERT INTO game_translations (game_id, language_code, title, description) SELECT id, 'en', 'The Secret of Monkey Island', 'I cursed my luck again as I slid down the monkey''s throat. Have my dreams of guzzling grog and plundering galleons been reduced to this? "Three small trials and you''re a pirate like us," they said. Fair enough. If only I could stomach the foul brew these scurvy seadogs swilled, the rest would be easy. How could I have known I''d meet a powerful and beautiful woman with a jealous suitor too stupid to realize he''d been dead for years? And how can I crawl through this great stone monkey to find a man who walks three inches above the ground and sets fire to his beard every morning?
